<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Criar álbum virtual</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Young+Serif&family=Figtree:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6f2f8;--card:#fff;--ink:#241a2e;--mute:#6d6277;--line:#e3dbe9;--rose:#e0476f;
--serif:"Young Serif",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Figtree",system-ui,sans-serif;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);color-scheme:light}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#181220;--card:#241b2f;--ink:#f3eef7;--mute:#a99dba;--line:#382c47;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#181220;--card:#241b2f;--ink:#f3eef7;--mute:#a99dba;--line:#382c47;color-scheme:dark}
html{height:100%;scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 var(--sans)}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
button,input,textarea{font:inherit;color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--rose);outline-offset:2px}
main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 18px 190px}
h1{font:400 clamp(30px,8vw,40px)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:0 0 8px}
.lead{color:var(--mute);margin:0 0 24px}
fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 26px}
legend{font:400 20px var(--serif);padding:0;margin-bottom:10px}
label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:12px 0 4px}
input[type=text],input[type=date],input[type=time],textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card)}
textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.drop{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:24px 16px;border:2px dashed var(--rose);border-radius:18px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card);margin:0}
.drop b{font:400 18px var(--serif)}.drop span{color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;font-weight:400}
.drop input{display:none}
#list{list-style:none;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:10px}
.item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:72px 1fr auto;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--card)}
.item img{width:72px;height:72px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px}
.item input{padding:8px 10px;font-size:14px}
.ctl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.ctl button{width:34px;height:30px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--line);cursor:pointer}
.ctl button:hover{background:var(--rose);color:#fff}
.bar{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:12px 18px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.bar>div{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:8px}
.cta,.sec{width:100%;padding:14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}
.cta{border:0;background:var(--rose);color:#fff}
.sec{border:2px solid var(--rose);background:transparent;color:var(--rose)}
.cta:disabled,.sec:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--mute);margin:0;text-align:center}
#pv{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:20;background:#120c19}
#pv iframe{width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
#pvb{position:absolute;left:12px;top:calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px));z-index:2;border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:#fff;cursor:pointer}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Monte seu álbum</h1>
  <p class="lead">Ao final você baixa um arquivo único, com fotos, música, contador e animações dentro. Dá para guardar e enviar a quem quiser.</p>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Capa</legend>
    <label for="title">Título</label>
    <input type="text" id="title" value="Nossa história" maxlength="40">
    <label for="to">Para quem?</label>
    <input type="text" id="to" placeholder="Ex.: Ana" maxlength="40">
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Carta de abertura (opcional)</legend>
    <label for="letter">Escreva sua carta</label>
    <textarea id="letter" style="min-height:170px" placeholder="Meu amor, preparei este álbum para guardar nossos melhores momentos…"></textarea>
    <label for="seal">Iniciais no lacre</label>
    <input type="text" id="seal" value="D&amp;M" maxlength="5">
    <p class="hint" style="text-align:left;margin-top:6px">Ela cai do céu presa por um laço em forma de coração. Ao tocar, o laço se desfaz e a carta se abre, antes do álbum.</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Contador do namoro</legend>
    <div class="row">
      <div><label for="date">Início do namoro</label><input type="date" id="date" value="2024-12-02"></div>
      <div><label for="time">Hora (opcional)</label><input type="time" id="time"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="hint" style="text-align:left;margin-top:6px">A data e a hora definem o contador e o mapa do céu (Catanduva, SP) na contracapa. Sem hora, usamos 20h para o mapa.</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Fotos</legend>
    <label class="drop" for="files"><b>Escolher fotos</b><span>Você pode selecionar várias de uma vez</span>
      <input type="file" id="files" accept="image/*" multiple></label>
    <ul id="list"></ul>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Mensagem final</legend>
    <label for="msg">Escreva o que quiser dizer</label>
    <textarea id="msg" placeholder="Cada momento com você é o meu favorito."></textarea>
    <label for="sign">Assinatura</label>
    <input type="text" id="sign" placeholder="Com amor, Pedro" maxlength="40">
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Música (opcional)</legend>
    <label class="drop" for="mus"><b id="musName">Escolher uma música</b><span>Arquivo de áudio. Quanto mais leve, menor o álbum.</span>
      <input type="file" id="mus" accept="audio/*"></label>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="bar"><div>
    <button class="cta" id="dl" disabled>Baixar álbum</button>
    <button class="sec" id="prev" disabled>Pré-visualizar</button>
    <p class="hint" id="hint">Adicione pelo menos uma foto.</p>
  </div></div>
</main>

<div id="pv" hidden><button id="pvb">Voltar e editar</button><iframe id="pvf" allow="autoplay" title="Pré-visualização"></iframe></div>

<!-- Álbum final: este bloco vira o arquivo baixado -->
<template id="vt">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
body{background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%,#3a2a4d 0%,#1c1426 60%,#120c19 100%);color:#f3eef7;font:16px/1.5 Figtree,system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;touch-action:pan-y;padding:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) 0 env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit}
.top{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;padding:10px 12px;min-height:52px}
#mute{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}
.stage{flex:1;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;perspective:1600px;min-height:0}
#book{position:relative;width:min(92vw,400px);height:min(600px,calc(100vh - 160px));box-shadow:4px 2px 0 -1px #e6dfee,8px 4px 0 -2px #d5cce0,0 24px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.55);border-radius:6px 16px 16px 6px}
.leaf{position:absolute;inset:0;transform-origin:left center;transition:transform .95s cubic-bezier(.45,.05,.25,1),opacity .2s}
.leaf.t{transform:rotateY(-155deg);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:transform .95s cubic-bezier(.45,.05,.25,1),opacity .45s .4s}
.pg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#f8f5fa;color:#241a2e;border-radius:6px 16px 16px 6px;box-shadow:inset 8px 0 12px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
.cover{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#4a2a5e,#2a1838);color:#f6e7c4;border:1px solid #d6ad63;box-shadow:inset 10px 0 14px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.6);cursor:pointer}
.cover::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:12px;border:2px solid rgba(214,173,99,.45);border-radius:4px 12px 12px 4px}
.cover h2{font:400 clamp(34px,10vw,48px)/1.08 "Young Serif",Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 18px;color:#d6ad63}
.cover p{margin:4px 0;font:500 28px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive}
.cover small{margin-top:26px;opacity:.75;font-size:13px}
.count h3,.end h3{font:400 26px "Young Serif",Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 16px}
.units{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;width:100%;position:relative;z-index:1}
.u{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 4px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}
.u b{display:block;font:400 34px/1.1 "Young Serif",Georgia,serif;color:#e0476f;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.u span{font-size:13px;color:#6d6277}
.since{font:700 26px/1.2 Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;margin:18px 0 0;position:relative;z-index:1}
.hp{position:absolute;bottom:-24px;color:#e0476f;opacity:0;animation:up 7s linear infinite}
@keyframes up{0%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:0}15%{opacity:.5}100%{transform:translateY(-640px);opacity:0}}
.polaroid{margin:0;background:#fff;padding:12px 12px 6px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transform:rotate(var(--r,-2deg));position:relative;max-width:100%}
.polaroid::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;width:84px;height:24px;margin-left:-42px;background:rgba(224,71,111,.35);transform:rotate(3deg)}
.polaroid img{display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:calc(100vh - 400px);min-height:140px;object-fit:contain;background:#eee;margin:0 auto}
.cap{font:700 28px/1.1 Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;padding:10px 4px 6px;min-height:34px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.num{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:16px;font:500 20px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;color:#8a7d97}
.end p{font:500 28px/1.25 Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-height:62%;overflow:auto}
.end em{display:block;margin-top:20px;font:700 30px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;color:#e0476f;font-style:normal}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 0 18px}
.nav button{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:50%;border:0;background:#e0476f;color:#fff;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer}
.nav button:disabled{opacity:.3}
#cnt{min-width:64px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;opacity:.8}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
#intro{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:50;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;transition:opacity .7s;background:radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 12% 18%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 80% 12%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(2px 2px at 65% 30%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 25% 40%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 90% 45%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(2px 2px at 8% 72%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 50% 7%,#fff 50%,transparent),radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%,#3a2a4d 0%,#1c1426 60%,#120c19 100%)}
#intro.out{opacity:0}
.env{position:relative;width:min(80vw,300px);aspect-ratio:3/2;background:#f6eef3;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.55);cursor:pointer;animation:fall 2.8s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.3,1) both;perspective:600px}
.flap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:62%;background:#e8d9e3;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,50% 100%);transform-origin:top;transition:transform .7s .6s}
.env.open .flap{transform:rotateX(180deg)}
.rv,.rh{position:absolute;background:#e0476f;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #c42f58;transition:transform .6s .15s,opacity .5s .3s}
.rv{left:50%;top:0;bottom:0;width:24px;margin-left:-12px}
.rh{top:50%;left:0;right:0;height:24px;margin-top:-12px}
.env.open .rv{transform:scaleY(0);opacity:0}
.env.open .rh{transform:scaleX(0);opacity:0}
.bw{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:112px;height:101px;margin:-52px 0 0 -56px;overflow:visible;transition:transform .9s ease-in,opacity .9s ease-in;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.3))}
.env.open .bl{transform:translate(-100px,-60px) rotate(-40deg);opacity:0}
.env.open .br{transform:translate(100px,-60px) rotate(40deg);opacity:0}
.env.open .bk{transform:scale(0);opacity:0}
.tip{margin:30px 0 0;font:700 26px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;color:#f6e7c4;animation:pulse 1.8s ease-in-out 2.8s infinite;opacity:0;animation-fill-mode:both}
@keyframes fall{0%{transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(-18deg)}55%{transform:translateY(10px) rotate(6deg)}75%{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(-3deg)}100%{transform:none}}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.45}50%{opacity:1}}
.ltr{width:min(92vw,400px);max-height:calc(100vh - 150px);overflow:auto;background:#f8f5fa;color:#241a2e;border-radius:8px;padding:30px 26px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.55);animation:pop .8s ease both}
.ltr h3{font:400 26px "Young Serif",Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 14px}
.ltr p{font:500 27px/1.25 Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left}
.ltr em{display:block;margin-top:16px;font:700 30px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;color:#e0476f;font-style:normal;text-align:right}
#go{margin-top:22px;padding:14px 28px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:#e0476f;color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;animation:pop .8s .5s ease both}
@keyframes pop{from{transform:translateY(30px) scale(.85);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}
.bcov{background:linear-gradient(200deg,#1f2a55,#0d1230);color:#f6e7c4;border:1px solid #d6ad63;box-shadow:inset 10px 0 14px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.6);padding:20px 16px}
.bcov::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:12px;border:2px solid rgba(214,173,99,.45);border-radius:4px 12px 12px 4px;pointer-events:none}
.bcov h3{font:400 24px "Young Serif",Georgia,serif;color:#d6ad63;margin:0 0 10px}
.skyw{width:100%;max-width:300px}.skyw svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:calc(100vh - 410px);margin:0 auto}
.bd{font:700 26px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;margin:8px 0 0}.bd2{font:500 24px Caveat,"Segoe Script",cursive;margin:0;opacity:.9}
.bcov small{margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;opacity:.65;max-width:250px}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.leaf,.leaf.t{transition:opacity .3s}.hp{animation:none}.env{animation:none}.tip{animation:none;opacity:1}}
</style>
